      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi yecha khu Yehu okhwa Hanani, aboolele Baasha ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ese nakhuniinia ewe khukhwama khwipukhuulu, nakhukhola waba omwami owe babaandu base Isiraeli. Ne luno ewe wakholile kamamayaanu nga ka Yeroboamu mala wakholile babaandu base khukhola bumayaanu. Wambambiisie lirima sikila bumayaanu bwowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakhurusiao ewe ne enju yowo. Ndakhola enju yowo nga nakhola eya Yeroboamu okhwa Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owe enju yowo yesi yesi ne alifwiila mu lukoba, chimbwa chilimulia. Ne ne alifwiila mu lukoongo, chinyuni chilimulia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bibiindi bioosi nibio Baasha akhola ne kamaani kewe, biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano che Babaami ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha afwa mala asiikhwa mu Tirisa, mala omwana wewe Ela, amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khwako, elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi yecha ne omung'oosi Yehu okhwa Hanani khu Baasha ne khu be enju yewe sikila, kamamayaanu niko Baasha akholela Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Akhola Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aba ne lirima khulwe bikholwa biewe ne khuba nga be enju eya Yeroboamu. Ne lundi eera be enju eya Yeroboamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Ela owa Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kwe kamakhumi kabili na sita kwe mu khwamiia khwa Asa omwami owa Yuda, Ela okhwa Baasha arakikha khukhwamiia Isiraeli. Amiia mu Tirisa khu miiko kibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Simuri, komanda owe nusu ye kamakaari ke liie ko mwami, amukwangwaanila. Nga Ela aba e Tirisa, ne alikho ameelela mungo mwa Arisa owaba omwimeelesi mu lichipi lia ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simuri engila munju amupa mala amwiira. Mala amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe. Lino liakholekha mu mwiiko kwe kamakhumi kabili na saba nikwo omwami Asa abeela omwami owa Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Simuri ne ekhala khu ndebe eye bubwami busa ari, eera enju eya Baasha yoosi. Se alekhakho omundu owe siseecha akhaba mulala khu balebe bewe namwe khu basaale bewe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khwako Simuri onakila elala enju eya Baasha khuloondekhana ne elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi niyo aloma khu Baasha khubirira khu mung'oosi Yehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kano kekholekha sikila bumayaanu bwoosi bwa Baasha ne bumayaanu bwa Ela omwana wewe nibwo bakhola. Lundi akhola Isiraeli yakhola bumayaanu. Baambia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi owa Isiraeli lirima khulwe bifwaani bie bawele babwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bibiindi bioosi nibio Ela akhola biaandikwa mu Sitabu sie chingano che Babaami ba Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Simuri owa Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kwe kamakhumi kabili na saba kwe mu bwami bwa Asa omwami owa Yuda, Simuri amiia khukhwama e Tirisa, khu Isiraeli khu ndaalo saba. Banamae ba Isiraeli baba bapile ekambi embi a lukoba lwa Kibetioni mu Filisiti khukhwibwaakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga banamae ne baulila bali Simuri aba akwangwaaniile omwami mala amwirire, Isiraeli yoosi yakhola Omuri, komanda owe banamae, aaba omwami owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Omuri ne banamae bewe bama e Kibetioni mala bacha babotookhelela lukoba lwa Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nga Simuri ne abona ali lukoba lwabukuliibwe, acha engila mu lusiro lwe lichipi lio mwami osia lichipi mala afwila omwene mu mulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino liekholekha sikila bumayaanu bwewe nibwo akhola ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Akhola nga Yeroboamu owakhola Isiraeli yakhola bumayaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bibiindi bioosi nibio Simuri akhola, ne ekwangwaani yewe, biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano che babaami ba Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omwami Omuri owa Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babaandu ba Isiraeli baukhanamo abili: Balala baloonda khu Tibini okhwa Kinati ne babaandi baloonda khu Omuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ekhumaliilikha, abo babaloonda Omuri baba ne kamaani khukhila ba Tibini. Tibini okhwa Kinati afwa mala Omuri aba omwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola kamakhumi kataru na mulala Asa ne ali omwami owa Yuda Omuri arakikha khukhwamiia Isiraeli. Amiia khu miiko ekhumi na kibili. Kimiiko kie khunyoa sita amiia khukhwama e Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akula sikulu sia Samaria khu bitonyi bie efwesa chikiilo kamakhumi saba na munane khukhwama khu Shemeri. Omuri ombakha lukoba khu sikulu okhwo mala alusira alutiuukha ali Samaria, lisina lia Shemeri, owaba omwene sikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
