              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri akhola bumayaanu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. Akhola bumayaanu khukhila boosi babanyoa ebweeni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhola nga Yeroboamu okhwa Nebati ne akhola Isiraeli yakhola bumayaanu. Baambia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli lirima sikila bifwaani biabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono bikholwa bibiindi bioosi nibio Omuri akhola, ne kamaani niko okesia biaandikwa mu sitabu sie chingano che Babaami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri afwa mala asiikhwa mu Samaria. Omwana wewe Ahabu amiia mu bweyaangu bwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu omwami owa Isiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola kamakhumi kataru na munane kwe bubwami bwa Asa owa Yuda, Ahabu okhwa Omuri arakikha khukhwamiia Isiraeli. Amiia mu Samaria khu miiko kamakhumi kabili na kibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu akhola kamamayaanu ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi khukhila babaami boosi babanyoa ebweeni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khutasa khukhola bumayaanu nga nibwo Yeroboamu okhwa Nebati akhola, Ahabu akhola bumayaanu bukali khulwe khukhwa Yesebeli omukhaana owo mwami Etibaali owa Sidoni khuba omukhasi wewe. Akholela Baali ne khumwisaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ombakhila Baali alutare mu nju eyayo niyo ombakha mu Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi akhola sifwaani sia wele Ashera. Akhola kamabi lukali khuaambia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli lirima khukhila babaami ba Isiraeli boosi babanyoa ebweeni wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh. 6.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu bwami bwewe, Hieli khukhwama e Beteli ombakha lukoba lwa Yeriko. Liabukula Hieli bulamu bwa Abiramu, omwana wewe omubele khurao kumusiingi kwe lukoba ne omwana wewe, Sekubu, omuro khukhwombakha bilibwa. Lino liekholekha khuloondekhana ne elomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, niyo aloma khubirira khu Yoshua okhwa Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
